Comment:
 WinIso-NG is an independent fork of WoeUSB-ng (GPL-3+), which in turn is a
 Python rewrite of the original WoeUSB and WinUSB tools.
 The interface is inspired by the layout of Rufus (GPL-3+, by Pete Batard),
 but WinIso-NG shares no source code with it: everything was written from
 scratch in Python for Linux.
